cate with the operator</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Role Swapping</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At regular intervals, roles switch. The <strong>Explorer</strong> returns to <i>safety</i>, and the <strong>Operator</strong> must enter the environment themselves. Both players must adapt, communicate, and trust each other to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action depends on coordination. The <strong>Explorer</strong> must rely on the <strong>Operator's</strong> instructions to solve puzzles, avoid danger, and progress, while the Operator must interpret limited data and make quick decisions under pressure. Mistakes can be costly, and tension builds as the threat becomes more aggressive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4688570/extras/e109138182fd0fda0a5c5679281d38c5.poster.avif?t=1785782316\" width=1170 height=552 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4688570/extras/e109138182fd0fda0a5c5679281d38c5.webm?t=1785782316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4688570/extras/e109138182fd0fda0a5c5679281d38c5.mp4?t=1785782316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several types of puzzles requiring communication and deduction skills in order to complete. Collecting items, looking for clues, listening to sounds and searching the environment will be crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4688570/extras/2c29c1f9d63576e3901b3734e0f12e68.poster.avif?t=1785782316\" width=1170 height=552 ><source src=\"https